# Parallel isolation

- Multiple agents or races → `parallel-worktrees` / `scripts/new-worktree.sh`.
- Never two writers on one dirty working tree.
- Prefer parallel only for independent tickets or intentional races.
- Human (or lead session) merges; record winner in `artifacts/reviews/`.
